# Sureshot Sower's activated ability is activated from the hand (CR 602.2b, 601.2c, 601.2h): its target is chosen first, then
# it is discarded as the cost, so it is in the graveyard while the ability destroys Bot2's Ornithopter - the only
# creature with flying. Bot1's own Forest is still untapped because Black Lotus paid for the rest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Sureshot Sower
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sureshot Sower.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
